授業科目の目的・目標・履修条件について.授業科目の目的（英語）:
This course introduces the basic concepts of statistical estimation (point and interval estimation) and hypothesis testing, focusing especially on the underlying mathematical theory.
Topics include:
・Mathematical discussions of particular statistical methods, especially notions of optimality in estimation and testing;
・General principles of statistical inference;
・Likelihood-based methods, including maximum likelihood estimation and likelihood ratio testing.
